# Collapsing a project hides its tasks behind a count of open tasks, and expanding shows them again.
file <<END
Trip to Japan:
	- Book flights
	- Reserve hotel
	- Get JR pass @done(2026-10-01)
Groceries:
	- Milk
END
keys h
see Trip to Japan: ▸ 2
hide Book flights
keys l
see - Book flights
see ✔ Get JR pass
quit
saved <<END
Trip to Japan:
	- Book flights
	- Reserve hotel
	- Get JR pass @done(2026-10-01)
Groceries:
	- Milk
END
